module narthex-compat

// The Prometheus release this oracle answers for. Pinned so a conformance run compares against one
// fixed engine: `v0.315.1` is the Go module version of the Prometheus 3.15.1 release.
//
// Note that the goldens checked in under `src/promql/src/**/prometheus_cases.txt` were generated
// from Prometheus 3.15.0 (`v0.315.0`). This oracle deliberately tracks the latest stable patch of
// the same minor line rather than the goldens' exact patch.
